==Trivia==
[[Kyoko Umemoto]] illustrated both a {{TCG ID|EX Crystal Guardians|Diglett|50}} card and a {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Dugtrio|93}} card for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]]; though the cards did not originally release together in the TCG—being released in 2006 and 2020 respectively—their illustrations were later included alongside each other in Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket's {{TCGP|Mega Shine}} expansion. This card's illustration references the Diglett from {{TCG ID|Mega Shine|Diglett|33}}'s illustration in its background.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Dugtrio|93}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Mud Bomb}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Dugtrio}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

